    {
      "id": "98464105-c776-4972-ae45-2b90a3984fa9",
      "title": "Observe a cena e entre no contexto da aula.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 4,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c5baedcc-32df-480b-bbc2-1472eb8d4a91",
          "textContent": "<p>No dia a dia, alguns verbos do presente mudam dentro da palavra.</p><p>Nesta aula, o foco é reconhecer essas mudanças em frases curtas sobre voltar para casa, dormir e dar opinião sobre onde se mora.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/bd0c579caf534a4f836dad6fbf53a27c_b01-contexto-volver-a-casa.png?Expires=1794099496&Signature=K4TzB0JTkJr41aIof~ADfOZLwsvnSqUzug8yGLVPis5qg3jGFUyqoIyy6a8EMX0iEzLGaH-fRkAnU0xDeOO0dcFDQSPboGlGskjH4rIbJQGMqmlxnUkz0VILxzaJnjAyRJETmxEgW3oO3P4avROhmXsb1A2-XIBkNok-ryW2Cuk7y61CWRlXPu815htyFNpHV6BmOvnjBj3Bs8bnCV23kGBaxmlX3jNL9ItkdOoW5347oFLb5Qo-BKDajzbNZyoNZVDa3c1~dc9FaSKlQKc2cdiK1AjI6AzIT1qvzteU08fd0YUszQNQsRigD03nL7-O5ezxN7P89h-0ONvt6Oapdw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "091c54e8-0efe-49b2-aa5a-9a6603a96724",
      "title": "Escute a frase e observe a forma em destaque.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "d0dd0a6a-5089-4027-aa31-9deb5f84823c",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Vuelvo al apartamento a las seis casi todos los días.</strong></p><p>Em português: Volto para o apartamento às seis quase todos os dias.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/63134b10f7b2477daf5df5deffb0b415_b02-vuelvo-al-apartamento-a-las-seis.mp3?Expires=1794099496&Signature=oG-h1cxTqRkjynQQ87LeyXu~5sCr~kGr1VYG0MaQpsQiMGwd-CJ~E17FVYGbXcE0tNc~4VcgvHl~xqNlKKwkAp2mEo7Zf3uNspYnG3o5odwaSUfXuiISILHUD7DuDfYEF4rYB5oN3lM211Y~RYNHTfRxYbd4KsQEJE3xFfz-P-9apyXfrSNbextAUleZlZ3FjjmM9naetPmpoubItu4WuBQ5xVFJRGwvFlAkY-zDkXs1fwbrdtgFrnxBaHIU07Pw3aeJqNuszlHL~e1v7dsEWfEYzO3Q~iaZJgwzx9eg3cxVyoYi0~VMNq6KaEXcXD8YiLA-rbHCHFa0-AXSIkCgeQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d0d5d5af-b231-4ac7-8586-05332b70513d",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e repare na parte do verbo que mudou.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "5e8e3026-45a6-49b4-8a6c-54ea4a5e84ca",
          "textContent": "<p>A frase fala de um hábito, por isso está no presente.</p><p>Com <strong>volver</strong>, a forma muda assim: <strong>volver -&gt; vuelvo</strong>.</p><p>A mudança principal aqui é <strong>o -&gt; ue</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0c6fd022-fb1b-4ddf-94d0-40aca9ce6ea3",
      "title": "Escute a frase e observe a forma usada com `tú`.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "beb28024-b40a-4cf5-b1cd-2ac4d2569730",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Duermes poco cuando hace mucho calor en tu cuarto.</strong></p><p>Em português: Você dorme pouco quando faz muito calor no seu quarto.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e973b443545740aab2a8f5fc3fc5f5d0_b04-duermes-poco-cuando-hace-calor.mp3?Expires=1794099496&Signature=KYq5rOteVjjTHz35xYsn0bRVKFSWgdzae12jDVka8TJbJ-29r0ADZuniP3en5VAPISbKBXMcTdmfZAvLK5PCLdGQgHsVPXtpwG7a78H5j1jjr-PgjhYKJDE~ue3n1b4KpUvf~78j8t6YkWU9fVC1AZr9evgUZ-72s0qSXx0-CYNeh6ULCQo57q9Q3JtHJZackTS8mun-zVGXzTVvKZKl9DaUFdByi-zgtN3PDp40NTVH9yoIOSfj4YNoBU53gFdYAdLIxh7aBmSkFxWkhrd3HfUXzovvwZqMQeXSBFPFMRK4oU1PC8PpYkw2Ew7ujsOnaQJwVhhfJimmBHp291casQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d346fc4f-14a1-4dc6-96fb-592c119ea5df",
      "title": "Leia a explicação e compare a mudança com a tela anterior.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "3383fb63-df3f-40be-a8d8-37535e608810",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a mesma mudança aparece com outra pessoa.</p><p><strong>dormir -&gt; duermes</strong></p><p>Com <strong>tú</strong>, a vogal também muda de <strong>o</strong> para <strong>ue</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "11d97a7e-4f6f-43d9-91e0-a2278f646e73",
      "title": "Escute a frase e observe a nova forma irregular em destaque.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "7fa9fc29-79f0-47af-bc93-1ef2c6289102",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Pienso que el alquiler es caro, pero el piso me gusta.</strong></p><p>Em português: Acho que o aluguel é caro, mas gosto do apartamento.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/fd24a1cb766245b9980547fd81335c5d_b06-pienso-que-el-alquiler-es-caro.mp3?Expires=1794099496&Signature=ABPI9Ejzjs7x-fs6vIxlFd-~3htKLHeTkhk4SVhTFwwopemFz~B3nBJWCxa9EbAbx1T8-9p9ddDKlOTBKmEARV7dsurg8GqJAbHjs9702Y0zlMYKx0LC04Ju-2Vy6cCfiTN8KenMUF1K9i-iFfI4BjxMo5kSMVm6SsKWfIZTvKtRjIlF5f5F9XDmABRdpQ8fp7P8tLlplF~ptELEogBLoOp3QPmxkXTgL~da3a-WKQcQlSyGgaLrBYYroF8aorkp9~6qYc2nD6C4fahad~lcfehHQV2lM~Z7Hqs~Xf64WIODBsrb0IkxX5Z1E6sD63xYRgoPHd836~SH4OVy0lAYfw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9027a964-e363-4810-9b42-f84654999970",
      "title": "Leia a nota e repare em como a raiz muda nesta forma.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 8,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "ec6b4efc-e3a9-4604-9b74-7e17cf277874",
          "textContent": "<p>Aqui o padrão é outro.</p><p><strong>pensar -&gt; pienso</strong></p><p>Neste verbo, a letra <strong>e</strong> vira <strong>ie</strong>.</p><p>Ao contrário de um verbo regular como <strong>hablo</strong>, a raiz muda.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "52fcffc3-5c7f-40d0-8880-3b6763331546",
      "title": "Leia o quadro curto e compare os padrões.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 9,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c2435400-4be5-41b4-98f8-ac512e358d14",
          "textContent": "<p>Compare os dois movimentos centrais desta aula.</p><ul><li><strong>o -&gt; ue</strong>: <strong>vuelvo</strong>, <strong>duermes</strong></li><li><strong>e -&gt; ie</strong>: <strong>pienso</strong></li></ul><p>No mesmo grupo de <strong>pensar</strong>, a mudança não aparece em todas as pessoas: <strong>pensamos</strong> continua sem <strong>ie</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "83dfb8d7-6fef-4985-baaa-535eb282dbb8",
      "title": "Leia o recap e reconheça o papel de cada forma no contexto.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 10,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "ba73c920-e4b1-4929-aa60-1414eec2b844",
          "textContent": "<p>Na vida real, essas formas ajudam a falar da rotina em casa e da sua opinião sobre onde mora.</p><ul><li><strong>Vuelvo al apartamento a las seis casi todos los días.</strong></li><li><strong>Duermes poco cuando hace mucho calor en tu cuarto.</strong></li><li><strong>Pienso que el alquiler es caro, pero el piso me gusta.</strong></li></ul><p>O fechamento da aula é reconhecer que alguns verbos do presente mudam dentro da raiz, mas nem todos mudam do mesmo jeito.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    }
  ],
